PurpleHaze monorepo — license overview

This repository combines independently licensed components. Moving them into
one repository does not replace their licenses or relicense their history.
The following files contain the applicable original terms and notices:

* iOS PurpleHaze application: Apache License 2.0; see ios/LICENSE and
  ios/ThirdPartyNotices.txt. Original copyright notices remain in the sources.

* Android AndIodine-derived application: ISC-style terms, described by its
  upstream as "the same terms as iodine"; see android/README.md and the full
  notice in android/src/main/res/raw/license. PurpleHaze branding and icon
  contributions carry Apache License 2.0 notices in
  android/third-party/LICENSE-PurpleHaze.txt.

* Shared iodine engine: ISC; see vendor/iodine/LICENSE. Individual third-party
  source notices, including the MD5 implementation and DNS definitions, remain
  in vendor/iodine/src and are not superseded by this overview.

* Statically linked OpenSSL: Apache License 2.0; see
  android/third-party/LICENSE-OpenSSL.txt and ios/ThirdPartyNotices.txt.
  OpenSSL sources and generated libraries are fetched/built locally or in CI.

* Additional platform notices are retained in the app About views and bundled
  notice files. Refer to each named component's notice for its copyright holders
  and complete terms.

No blanket monorepo license is substituted for these component licenses.
